OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's replacement as Greater
OL,7,FManchester mayor will be announced on
OL,8,FFriday following the largest by-
OL,9,Felection in British history.
OL,11,FVotes from Thursday's by-election will
OL,12,Fbe counted throughout the day, with
OL,13,Fthe result expected to be declared in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon.
OL,16,FMore than two million people were
OL,17,Feligible to vote in the contest,
OL,18,Ftriggered by Mr Burnham's election to
OL,19,FParliament last month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
