OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FPolling ahead of Thursday's vote
OL,7,Fsuggested Labour candidate Bev Craig,
OL,8,Fcurrently the leader of Manchester
OL,9,FCity Council, was on course to win by
OL,10,Fa comfortable margin.
OL,12,FHer main rival is likely to be either
OL,13,FReform UK's Sian Astley or the Green
OL,14,FParty's Geraldine Coggins.
OL,16,FOther candidates were Phil Eckersley
OL,17,F(Conservatives), Richard Kilpatrick
OL,18,F(Liberal Democrats), Marlon West
OL,19,F(Restore Britain) and Marcus Farmer
OL,20,F(Independent).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
