OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FMr Burnham voted at a polling station
OL,7,Fin Golborne, near Wigan, late on
OL,8,FThursday, casting his ballot less than
OL,9,Fan hour before polls closed.
OL,11,FAfter voting finished on Thursday,
OL,12,FLabour deputy leader Lucy Powell said
OL,13,Fher party had run "a really positive
OL,14,Fcampaign" and been "on the front foot,
OL,15,Fsetting out our stall, showing what
OL,16,FLabour in power can do".
OL,26,@uD@SOUvD@IO]vD@TOUxD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
