OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785458899
OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FShe said: "Through our candidate Bev
OL,7,FCraig and our new Prime Minister, Andy
OL,8,FBurnham, we have heard from many
OL,9,Fpeople who are giving Labour another
OL,10,Flook. Labour is offering hope.
OL,12,F"If the voters of Greater Manchester
OL,13,Fput their trust in Labour, we will all
OL,14,Fwork tirelessly to put Bev's promises
OL,15,Finto action."
OL,17,FMs Coggins said her party had seen
OL,18,F"former Labour voters move to the
OL,19,FGreens in droves" and shown it could
OL,20,F"challenge the larger parties".
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@AOUwD@MO]zD@AOU{D@QO]|D@AOU|D@
