OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FShe said: "A new prime minister who is
OL,7,Fpopular in this region meant that we
OL,8,Fwere contesting this election in
OL,9,Funusual circumstances. However, we
OL,10,Ffound real discontent across Greater
OL,11,FManchester with how Labour have been
OL,12,Frunning this place, and the people
OL,13,Fwant a change of direction.
OL,15,F"This includes clear commitments on
OL,16,Frent controls, affordable housing and
OL,17,Fto make sure people are put before
OL,18,Fprofit."
OL,26,@nD@KOUwD@AOUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
