OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FVotes will be counted on Friday, with
OL,7,Fthe winner expected to be announced in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,FIt is the first time a by-election has
OL,11,Fbeen necessary to fill a vacancy for
OL,12,Fone of England's combined authority
OL,13,Fmayors.
OL,15,FThe cost of the contest is expected
OL,16,Frun into the millions, with the 2024
OL,17,Fmayoral election costing the taxpayer
OL,18,F#4.7 million.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
