OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FThat contest saw Mr Burnham re-elected
OL,7,Fwith 63% of the vote under the "first
OL,8,Fpast the post" system, in which the
OL,9,Fcandidate with the most votes is
OL,10,Fdeclared the winner.
OL,12,FHe also received the most votes in
OL,13,Feach of Greater Manchester's 10 local
OL,14,Fauthority areas.
OL,16,FFor Thursday's by-election, voting
OL,17,Fchanged back to the "supplementary
OL,18,Fvote" (SV) system used in the mayoral
OL,19,Felections in 2017 and 2021.
OL,26,@oD@`OUpD@NO]yD@UOUzD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
