OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FIf any candidate wins more than 50% of
OL,7,Fthe first-choice votes, they are
OL,8,Fdeclared the winner.
OL,10,FIf no candidate has more than 50% of
OL,11,Ffirst-choice votes, all but the top
OL,12,Ftwo candidates are eliminated and the
OL,13,Fcount moves to a second round.
OL,15,FThe ballot papers of the eliminated
OL,16,Fcandidates are counted again and if
OL,17,Fthere are any second-choice votes for
OL,18,Fthe two remaining candidates, these
OL,19,Fare added to their first-choice totals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
