PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785458899
OL,3,CVote counting to begin in Greater
OL,4,CManchester mayoral by-election
OL,6,FThe candidate with the highest overall
OL,7,Ftotal of first and second-choice votes
OL,8,Fis declared the winner.
OL,10,FIn 2021, the last time Manchester was
OL,11,Fcontested under the SV system, Mr
OL,12,FBurnham won in the first round with
OL,13,F67% of first preference votes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
